# /teamwork

When `/teamwork` is specified, activate the `modes/teamwork-mode.md` modifier of `subagent-lane-planner`:
- Decompose the request into independent lanes with non-overlapping file scopes.
- Guarantee the single-writer invariant (zero concurrent edits to any single file).
- Keep shared entry files with the main coordinator and merge during final consolidation.
